# Harness scratch space: extracted plans, run logs, generated projects.
e2e/.work/

# Local research scratch (facts packs, spikes, probe logs).
.scratch/

# pnpm's content-addressable store. Any pnpm command run anywhere inside this repo resolves
# its store to the repo root, and the harness's commands (including the pnpm in the target
# under e2e/.work/) are no exception: measured, `pnpm store path` reports
# <repo>/.pnpm-store/v11 and neither npm_config_store_dir nor its kebab-case form moves it.
.pnpm-store/
